[0.574, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  \u001b[1mOn 6:\u001b[22m I like that direction and it interacts with your table question — see below. No seed means the DB starts empty; \r\u001b[1B  categories\u001b[1Caccumulate\u001b[1Cfrom\u001b[1Ceither\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Cmodel's\u001b[1Cparse\u001b[1Coutput\u001b[1Cor\u001b[1Cexplicit\u001b[1Cuser\u001b[1Cadds.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B---         \u001b[83C                     \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m─────────────────────────────────────────"]
