[0.555, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[2D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[4A  1. \u001b[1mScale doesn't justify it.\u001b[22m SQLite stores short TEXT efficiently — \"Entertainment\" is ~13 bytes, int is 4-8.         \r\u001b[1B  Single-user,\u001b[1Cthousands\u001b[1Cof\u001b[1Citems\u001b[1Cmax.\u001b[1CYou're\u001b[1Csaving\u001b[1Cmaybe\u001b[1C100KB\u001b[1Cever.\u001b[1CThat's\u001b[1Cnot\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Creason\u001b[1Cto\u001b[1Cnormalize.\r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m──────────────────────────────────────────────"]
