[0.005, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[60D\u001b[3B\r\u001b[10A\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m\u001b[38;2;175;175;175m❯ \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mPretty cool! When I click the dropdown there's always only one item showing, because it didn't change the text.\u001b[39m       \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mI think the text should NOT prepopulate into the combobox somehow. Like you click it and you can see the item was \u001b[39m    \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mgroceries, but you don't edit the word groceries. You type into a new empty box *below* that and it starts filtering.\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mThat also makes the unsaved-blur behavior a little clearer\u001b[39m                                                            \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✻\u001b[1CTransmuting… \u001b[39m  \u001b[1C   \u001b[1C            \u001b[1C        \u001b[1C \u001b[1C      \u001b[1C        \r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m "]
[0.000, "o", " ⎿  Tip: Working with HTML/CSS? Install the frontend-design plugin:\u001b[39m                                                    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[38;2;87;105;247m/plugin install frontend-design@claude-plugins-official\u001b[37C\u001b[39m                     \r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "───────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102m--\u001b[1CINSERT\u001b[1C--\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;0;153;153m2\u001b[1Cshells\u001b[74C\u001b[38;2;102;102;102mNow\u001b[1Cusing\u001b[1Cextra\u001b[1Cusage\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[3A\u001b[?2026l"]
