[0.000, "o", " \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m2. \"Create new\" in the category box should be 'category/add' + 'receipt/update', yes?\u001b[39m                                 \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m3. That's interesting. There's a gotcha there where if you mis-categorize as \"Misc\" and then switch it you have to \u001b[39m   \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mretype \"Misc\" on the item you mean to use. I think that's probably fine.\u001b[39m                                              \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m4. That's interesting. Easiest is to have a \"Unassigned\" category that can't go away IMO\u001b[39m                              \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m5. I wonder about having a link button on each category that jumps to the category page. Has stats + renamability.\u001b[39m    \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m6. Yeah I almost wonder about allowing the prompt to come up with categories outside the given set, and having no \u001b[39m    \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38"]
[0.000, "o", ";2;0;0;0mseed?\u001b[39m                                                                                                                 \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0m7. Yeah there are no external users of these libraries yet, but thanks for flagging\u001b[39m                                   \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m                                                                                                                        \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mOne other consideration – there will be a lot of duplicated strings with this approach. Should Category be a table \u001b[39m   \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;240;240;240m  \u001b[38;2;0;0;0mwith an id and a foreign key from receiptitem to category?\u001b[39m                                                            \u001b[49m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m⏺\u001b[1C\u001b[39mQuick\u001b[1Cacks\u001b[1Cfirst,\u001b[1Cthen\u001b[1Cthe\u001b[1Ctable\u001b[1Cquestion.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[1mOn\u001b[1C2:\u001b[1C\u001b[22mYes\u001b[1C—\u001b[1CUI\u001b[1Ccalls\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mPOST\u001b[1C/api/categories\u001b[1C\u001b[39mfirst,\u001b[1Cthen\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;87;105;247mPUT\u001b[1"]
